{"id":"wb-7-1427","name":"韩城九郎庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"韩城九郎庙","text":"九郎庙俗称救郎庙，位于中国陕西省渭南韩城市金城大街303号（北段东侧），是祭祀春秋时期晋国赵武、程婴和公孙杵臼的庙宇（韩城为“赵氏孤儿”故事发生地），2003年被列为第四批陕西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9F%A9%E5%9F%8E%E4%B9%9D%E9%83%8E%E5%BA%99","revisionId":90318646,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90318646","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0f419cc99e20735e40119a11.jpg","title":"Jiulang_Temple_in_Hancheng_02_2013-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiulang_Temple_in_Hancheng_02_2013-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Jiulang_Temple_in_Hancheng_02_2013-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​韩城九郎庙，正殿。","width":320,"height":240}}